    `expressed an objection to removal after death (officer has reason to believe)` IS FALSE
    `the death is or may be a reportable death (officer has reason to believe)` IS FALSE
    `the coroner consented, or directed that consent is not required` IS FALSE
    `respiration and circulation are maintained by artificial means` IS FALSE
