#ASSERT `Can my next of kin's objection stop my tissue being taken after I die` `as the donor` `Ruby, Jake's daughter, 46, objects` `Jake at 72, on the Register, Ruby objects` EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does my relative's objection stop the removal` `Ruby, Jake's daughter, 46, objects` `Jake at 72, on the Register, Ruby objects`))
