#ASSERT `Can my next of kin's objection stop my tissue being taken after I die` `as the donor` `Ruby, Jake's daughter, 46, objects` `Jake at 72, not on the Register, Ruby objects, Chloe consents` EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does my relative's objection stop the removal` `Ruby, Jake's daughter, 46, objects` `Jake at 72, not on the Register, Ruby objects, Chloe consents`))
