#ASSERT `Can my next of kin's objection stop my tissue being taken after I die` `as the donor` `Chloe, Jake's sister, 76, objects` `Jake at 72, not on the Register, Ruby consents, Chloe objects` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Can my next of kin's objection stop my tissue being taken after I die` `as the donor` `Chloe, Jake's sister, 76, objects` `Jake at 72, not on the Register, Ruby consents, Chloe objects` EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does my relative's objection stop the removal` `Chloe, Jake's sister, 76, objects` `Jake at 72, not on the Register, Ruby consents, Chloe objects`))
