#ASSERT `Whose consent governs donation of the person's tissue` `as the next of kin` `Daniel at 82, not on the Register, Priya not available, Anjali consents` EQUALS (`whose consent, carried` (`Whose consent governs donation of my tissue after death` `Daniel at 82, not on the Register, Priya not available, Anjali consents`))
